{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most public enums in OpenUSD aren’t correctly imported due to a bug in Swift-Cxx interop: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swiftlang\/swift\/issues\/62127"},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"This Swift Package provides a workaround by migrating the enums to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Overlay"},{"type":"text","text":" namespace. For example,"}]},{"code":["let stage = Overlay.Dereference(pxr.UsdStage.CreateInMemory(pxr.UsdStage.LoadAll)) \/\/ error: can't find pxr.UsdStage.LoadAll","let stage = Overlay.Dereference(pxr.UsdStage.CreateInMemory(Overlay.UsdStage.LoadAll)) \/\/ success: finds Overlay.UsdStage.LoadAll"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, when Swift can infer the type of the enum, you can use implicit member expressions. For example,"}]},{"code":["let stage = Overlay.Dereference(pxr.UsdStage.CreateInMemory(.LoadAll)) \/\/ success: infers pxr.UsdStage.LoadAll"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftUsd\/documentation\/SwiftUsd\/WrappedEnums","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftusd\/wrappedenums"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftusd\/wrappedenums"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftUsd\/documentation\/OpenUSD"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftUsd\/documentation\/OpenUSD\/Overlay","doc:\/\/SwiftUsd\/documentation\/SwiftUsd\/WrappedTypes","doc:\/\/SwiftUsd\/documentation\/SwiftUsd\/WrappedFunctions","doc:\/\/SwiftUsd\/documentation\/SwiftUsd\/WrappedOperators"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Wrapped-symbol-doc